CLKC-9#1 Advisory
BUFGCE with active CE has BUFG driver  
The BUFGCE cell msf_zynq_system_i/aup_zu3_io_0/inst/u_core_bufg msf_zynq_system_i/aup_zu3_io_0/inst/u_core_bufg/I pin (and CE is ACTIVE) is driven by BUFG_PS clock buffer msf_zynq_system_i/zynq_ultra_ps_e_0/inst/buffer_pl_clk_0.PL_CLK_0_BUFG. Please review your clocking topology. If this cascaded clocking topology is desired to meet the clock enable timing requirements, then this methodology check can be waived. If this cascaded clocking topology is not desired, it should be reconnected in parallel to the driving clock buffer in order to reduce skew. Cascaded buffers introduce skew that can lead to difficult or impossible timing closure.
